flowchart TD
    RAW["`**Raw Dataset**
    (epoch, sid) from RINEX store`"]

    RAW --> SIG["`**Signal Selection**
    keep_sids filter, obs type selection
    (applied upstream, before ops.Pipeline)`"]

    SIG --> TA["`**TemporalAggregate**
    resample → regular epoch grid
    configurable window (e.g. 1 min)`"]

    TA --> GA["`**GridAssignment**
    KDTree nearest-cell query
    2° equal-area hemigrid (default)`"]

    GA --> OUT["`**Transformed Dataset**
    + cell_id coord
    returned alongside PipelineResult
    (total_duration_seconds, to_metadata_dict())`"]

    OUT --> STORE["`**Icechunk Store**
    versioned, atomic commit`"]
